Alembic migrations for RagLens backend (async, psycopg 3).

Common commands (run from backend/):

    uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "your change"   # generate
    uv run alembic upgrade head                               # apply
    uv run alembic downgrade -1                               # rollback 1
    uv run alembic history                                    # list revisions
    uv run alembic current                                    # show current rev

Autogenerate looks at app.models — every model must be re-exported from
app/models/__init__.py or Alembic won't see it.
